{%- comment -%}
  Duties notice
  --------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Shows the disclaimer only in markets where duties are NOT collected at
  checkout — i.e. where the buyer really will be billed on delivery.

  Driven by a market metafield, set by hand per market:
    Settings → Custom data → Markets → custom.duties_collected (boolean)
    Tick it for markets where duty collection is enabled at checkout.

  Unset = treated as false = disclaimer shows. Deliberate: under-promising is
  recoverable, over-promising is a chargeback.

  NOTE: to invert (show when duties ARE collected), change `unless` to `if`.

  Usage:
    {% render 'duties-notice' %}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign duties_collected = false
  if localization.market.metafields.custom.duties_collected.value
    assign duties_collected = true
  endif
-%}

{%- unless duties_collected -%}
  <p class="duties-notice">{{ 'products.product.duties.notice' | t }}</p>
{%- endunless -%}
